{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04553","headline":"送李侍郎逈秀薛长史季昶同赋得水字 · 张说","name":"送李侍郎逈秀薛长史季昶同赋得水字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉郡接胡庭，幽幷对烽垒。\n旌旗按部曲，文武惟卿士。\n薛公善筹画，李相威边鄙。\n中冀分两河，长城各万里。\n藉马黄花塞，蒐兵白狼水。\n胜敌在安人，爲君汗青史。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}